{"composant":"AuditSeoGuide","id":"audit-seo-guide","url":"/blog/audit-seo-guide-complet","titre":"Audit SEO : Guide Complet Étape par Étape","excerpt":"Un audit SEO est l'analyse complète et approfondie de votre site web. Découvrez comment réaliser un audit SEO en 2026.","date":"09 MARS 2026","tag":"GUIDE","image":"/images/articles/audit-seo-guide.jpg","html":"<section id=\"introduction\" class=\"mb-16\"><div class=\"bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-600 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-r-2xl text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed shadow-sm\"><p class=\"mb-4\">Un <strong>audit SEO</strong> est l&#x27;analyse complète et approfondie de votre site web pour identifier tous les problèmes qui empêchent votre site de ranker sur Google. C&#x27;est la première étape essentielle de toute stratégie SEO efficace.</p><p class=\"mb-4\">Mais qu&#x27;est-ce qu&#x27;un audit SEO exactement ? Comment le réaliser ? Quels outils utiliser ? Et surtout, comment interpréter les résultats pour améliorer votre visibilité ?</p><p class=\"font-medium text-blue-800 m-0\">Ce guide complet vous explique tout ce que vous devez savoir sur l&#x27;audit SEO en 2026.</p></div></section><section id=\"quest-ce-que\" class=\"my-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-8 font-bold text-slate-900\">Qu&#x27;est-ce qu&#x27;un Audit SEO ?</h2><div class=\"mb-12\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 p-2 rounded-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search \"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg></span>Définition Précise</h3><p class=\"text-lg text-slate-600 mb-6\">Un <strong>audit SEO</strong> est une analyse systématique et complète de votre site web qui évalue :</p><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 not-prose\"><div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 p-2 rounded-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity \"><path d=\"M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 m-0\">Optimisation technique</h4></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 m-0\">Vitesse, structure, mobile-friendly, indexation</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 p-2 rounded-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-panels-top-left \"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 9h18\"></path><path d=\"M9 21V9\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 m-0\">Optimisation on-page</h4></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 m-0\">Mots-clés, titles, meta descriptions, headings</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 p-2 rounded-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-link \"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 m-0\">Optimisation off-page</h4></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 m-0\">Backlinks, mentions de marque, autorité</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"bg-orange-100 text-orange-600 p-2 rounded-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text \"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 m-0\">Contenu</h4></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 m-0\">Qualité, longueur, originalité, pertinence</p></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-12\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 p-2 rounded-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span>Pourquoi faire un audit SEO ?</h3><p class=\"text-lg text-slate-600 mb-6\">Un audit SEO vous permet de :</p><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 not-prose mb-8\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-blue-200 transition-colors\"><div class=\"bg-white text-blue-600 p-1.5 rounded-full shadow-sm mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-alert-circle \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg></div><div><strong class=\"block text-slate-900 mb-1\">Identifier les problèmes</strong><span class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\">Découvrir ce qui bloque votre visibilité</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-blue-200 transition-colors\"><div class=\"bg-white text-blue-600 p-1.5 rounded-full shadow-sm mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye-off \"><path d=\"M9.88 9.88a3 3 0 1 0 4.24 4.24\"></path><path d=\"M10.73 5.08A10.43 10.43 0 0 1 12 5c7 0 10 7 10 7a13.16 13.16 0 0 1-1.67 2.68\"></path><path d=\"M6.61 6.61A13.526 13.526 0 0 0 2 12s3 7 10 7a9.74 9.74 0 0 0 5.39-1.61\"></path><line x1=\"2\" x2=\"22\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg></div><div><strong class=\"block text-slate-900 mb-1\">Comprendre votre situation</strong><span class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\">Savoir où vous en êtes actuellement</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-blue-200 transition-colors\"><div class=\"bg-white text-blue-600 p-1.5 rounded-full shadow-sm mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers \"><path d=\"m12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83Z\"></path><path d=\"m22 17.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 17.65\"></path><path d=\"m22 12.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 12.65\"></path></svg></div><div><strong class=\"block text-slate-900 mb-1\">Prioriser les actions</strong><span class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\">Savoir par où commencer</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-blue-200 transition-colors\"><div class=\"bg-white text-blue-600 p-1.5 rounded-full shadow-sm mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bar-chart \"><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"20\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"18\" x2=\"18\" y1=\"20\" y2=\"4\"></line><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y1=\"20\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg></div><div><strong class=\"block text-slate-900 mb-1\">Mesurer les résultats</strong><span class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\">Avoir une baseline pour comparer</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-blue-200 transition-colors sm:col-span-2 md:col-span-1\"><div class=\"bg-white text-blue-600 p-1.5 rounded-full shadow-sm mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap \"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><div><strong class=\"block text-slate-900 mb-1\">Optimiser votre ROI</strong><span class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\">Investir dans les bonnes actions</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 p-5 rounded-r-xl\"><p class=\"text-amber-800 m-0 font-medium\">Sans audit SEO, vous travaillez à l&#x27;aveugle. Vous ne savez pas ce qui fonctionne et ce qui ne fonctionne pas.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 p-2 rounded-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers \"><path d=\"m12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83Z\"></path><path d=\"m22 17.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 17.65\"></path><path d=\"m22 12.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 12.65\"></path></svg></span>Les types d&#x27;audits SEO</h3><p class=\"text-lg text-slate-600 mb-6\">Il existe plusieurs types d&#x27;audits selon vos besoins :</p><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 not-prose\"><div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border-2 border-slate-100 hover:border-blue-200 transition-colors\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-500\"></span>Audit technique</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 m-0\">Analyse de la structure, vitesse, indexation, erreurs</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border-2 border-slate-100 hover:border-purple-200 transition-colors\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-500\"></span>Audit on-page</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 m-0\">Analyse des mots-clés, titles, meta descriptions, contenu</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border-2 border-slate-100 hover:border-emerald-200 transition-colors\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>Audit off-page</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 m-0\">Analyse des backlinks, mentions, autorité</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border-2 border-slate-100 hover:border-orange-200 transition-colors bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-orange-50/50\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></span>Audit complet</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 m-0\">Combinaison de tous les audits ci-dessus</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"processus\" class=\"my-20\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-12 font-bold text-center\">Processus d&#x27;Audit SEO Complet</h2><p class=\"text-center text-lg text-slate-600 mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Voici comment mettre en place un audit SEO efficace.</p><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute left-8 md:left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-200 via-purple-200 to-emerald-200 transform md:-translate-x-1/2 rounded-full hidden sm:block\"></div><div class=\"space-y-12 mt-8 relative z-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 md:flex-row-reverse\"><div class=\"hidden md:block md:w-1/2\"></div><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold text-2xl text-white shadow-xl z-10 border-4 border-white bg-blue-600 shadow-blue-200\">1</div><div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 md:pr-12 text-left md:text-right\"><div class=\"p-8 rounded-3xl border shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow bg-white relative overflow-hidden group\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-2 h-full bg-blue-50\"></div><h3 class=\"font-display font-bold text-2xl text-slate-900 mt-0 mb-3\">Audit technique</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-base mb-4 font-medium\">L&#x27;audit technique analyse la structure et la santé technique de votre site.</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 m-0 p-0 list-none md:flex md:flex-col md:items-end\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-blue-700\"></span><span>Vitesse de chargement : Moins de 3 secondes</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-blue-700\"></span><span>Mobile-friendly : Site responsive</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-blue-700\"></span><span>Indexation : Toutes les pages indexées</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-blue-700\"></span><span>Sitemap XML &amp; Robots.txt</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-blue-700\"></span><span>Erreurs 404 &amp; Redirections 301</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 \"><div class=\"hidden md:block md:w-1/2\"></div><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold text-2xl text-white shadow-xl z-10 border-4 border-white bg-purple-600 shadow-purple-200\">2</div><div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 md:pl-12 text-left\"><div class=\"p-8 rounded-3xl border shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow bg-white relative overflow-hidden group\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-2 h-full bg-purple-50\"></div><h3 class=\"font-display font-bold text-2xl text-slate-900 mt-0 mb-3\">Audit on-page</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-base mb-4 font-medium\">L&#x27;audit on-page analyse l&#x27;optimisation de chaque page pour les mots-clés.</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 m-0 p-0 list-none \"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-purple-700\"></span><span>H1 unique et optimisé</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-purple-700\"></span><span>Titles et Meta descriptions</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-purple-700\"></span><span>Headings (H2, H3) logiques</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-purple-700\"></span><span>Mots-clés pertinents</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-purple-700\"></span><span>Images optimisées (alt text)</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 md:flex-row-reverse\"><div class=\"hidden md:block md:w-1/2\"></div><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold text-2xl text-white shadow-xl z-10 border-4 border-white bg-emerald-600 shadow-emerald-200\">3</div><div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 md:pr-12 text-left md:text-right\"><div class=\"p-8 rounded-3xl border shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow bg-white relative overflow-hidden group\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-2 h-full bg-emerald-50\"></div><h3 class=\"font-display font-bold text-2xl text-slate-900 mt-0 mb-3\">Audit off-page</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-base mb-4 font-medium\">L&#x27;audit off-page analyse votre autorité et vos backlinks.</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 m-0 p-0 list-none md:flex md:flex-col md:items-end\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-700\"></span><span>Backlinks : Nombre, qualité, diversité</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-700\"></span><span>Domaines référents</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-700\"></span><span>Anchor text naturel</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-700\"></span><span>Mentions de marque</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-700\"></span><span>Autorité du domaine (DA)</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 \"><div class=\"hidden md:block md:w-1/2\"></div><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold text-2xl text-white shadow-xl z-10 border-4 border-white bg-blue-600 shadow-blue-200\">4</div><div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 md:pl-12 text-left\"><div class=\"p-8 rounded-3xl border shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow bg-white relative overflow-hidden group\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-2 h-full bg-blue-50\"></div><h3 class=\"font-display font-bold text-2xl text-slate-900 mt-0 mb-3\">Audit de contenu</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-base mb-4 font-medium\">L&#x27;audit de contenu analyse la qualité et la pertinence de votre contenu.</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 m-0 p-0 list-none \"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-blue-700\"></span><span>Longueur (1 500+ mots)</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-blue-700\"></span><span>Originalité (pas de duplicate)</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-blue-700\"></span><span>Pertinence avec l&#x27;intent</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-blue-700\"></span><span>Fraîcheur du contenu</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-blue-700\"></span><span>E-E-A-T démontré</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 md:flex-row-reverse\"><div class=\"hidden md:block md:w-1/2\"></div><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold text-2xl text-white shadow-xl z-10 border-4 border-white bg-purple-600 shadow-purple-200\">5</div><div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 md:pr-12 text-left md:text-right\"><div class=\"p-8 rounded-3xl border shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow bg-white relative overflow-hidden group\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-2 h-full bg-purple-50\"></div><h3 class=\"font-display font-bold text-2xl text-slate-900 mt-0 mb-3\">Audit UX/Engagement</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-base mb-4 font-medium\">L&#x27;audit UX analyse l&#x27;expérience utilisateur et l&#x27;engagement.</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 m-0 p-0 list-none md:flex md:flex-col md:items-end\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-purple-700\"></span><span>Taux de rebond</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-purple-700\"></span><span>Temps sur page</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-purple-700\"></span><span>Pages par session</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-purple-700\"></span><span>Navigation intuitive</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 text-purple-700\"></span><span>Mobile UX optimale</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"checklist\" class=\"my-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md